TITLE Albite kinetics + H2S(g), pe at step 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2 charge
    pe   0
    units mol/kgw
    Fe(3) 0.004
    Fe(2) 0.004

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -volume 1
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 10*100
    -cvode true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
